The '''Summit Ruins''' (Japanese: '''山の遺跡''' ''Mountain Ruins'') are {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive ruins located near the [[Pokémon Summer Academy]] and [[Mt. Coronet]]. They were featured in ''[[DP090|Ghoul Daze!]]'', in which one of the activities of the academy included the students pairing off in teams and retrieving a medal hidden in the ruins. 

A recent construction accident at the ruins revealed a secret cave believed to be an entrance to the [[Ghost World]]. A [[ghost girl]] emerged from the open portal and tried to lure people into the Ghost World, but was fortunately prevented from doing so by a {{pkmn2|wild}} {{p|Dusknoir}}. After it pushed the ghost back into the portal, the ruins collapsed, sealing the portal.

